# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the pitch cards while Shift (E5) moves the drones: lit, the pitch
# as heard, "SHIFT" under it; dark again once it's gone (review 5, 2026-10-28). And the SEL map's hint line, clear of
# the screen's edge. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
notips
tap PLAY
wait 2000
key w13 down
wait 1500
shot shift-in.png
wait 3000
shot shift-full.png
key w13 up
wait 8000
shot shift-gone.png
press SEL
wait 600
key b2 down
wait 300
shot selkey.png
key b2 up
release SEL
